91bc  level_tick_1         level 2's hazard, a vat (x0, y, x1, rows): sound 1Ah when (random & Fh) = 0; RoboCop's x in [x0 - 10h, x1 + 10h) and d = cam y + 98h - y in [0, 4Dh): copper_sprite_cut = CBh - d, and from d = 3Ch RoboCop dies ($169A high byte, $16CC, sound 10h: the camera's y decides); odd frames: (x1 - x0) / 16 + 1 columns x (rows + 2) map words from vat_column_phases
