92ba  vat_even_words       16 map words, the vat's rows 2, 4, 6... (attributes 0)
92da  vat_column_phases    a word per vat column (48 words up to $9339; level_tick_1 reads the first 23): low byte the phase (+2 on odd frames, written only at $923C, never reset); entry k + 1's high byte nonzero = variant 1 of column k
10356 copper_sprite_cut    byte: the line of the in-game copper's WAIT before copper_sprites_off (CA01 FFFE): CAh from $9154 every frame; level_tick_1 lowers it to a visible vat's surface
